obs The founding crux CAUM0 is the device's defining promise as a firmware invariant — a bounded session buffer that holds only while powered, persists nothing except on a deliberate commit, and provably dissolves (zeroes) on power-down (What forgets, protects). Proven pure in Rye before metal, exactly as ship_pilot proved the onboarding arc pure before wiring real modules.
obs Wrote the self-approved design round active-designing/20260814-020500 naming the shape (mikrophone/session.rye: capture / commit / power_down / carry) and the five invariants the CAUM0 witness will prove. Real Mikrophone hardware stays custody gate #2; this rung asks no network, signs no key, moves no funds.
